From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lef <me@lefteros.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 11:42:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: clock: google,zuma-clock: add CMU_HSI0 USI3
 clock IDs

The Pixel 8 Pro's GNSS receiver sits on HSI0 USI3 (Google's spi_21). Add
the IDs for its mux, divider and the three gates, in the same shape as
USI2's, after USI2's IDs. Only the header; the clock driver follows.

Signed-off-by: Lef <me@lefteros.com>
---
 include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zuma.h | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zuma.h b/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zuma.h
index a226cae5a..05db2859f 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zuma.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zuma.h
@@ -33,7 +33,7 @@
 #define CLK_DOUT_PERIC0_NOC		26
 #define CLK_DOUT_PERIC0_IP		27
 
-/* CMU_HSI0: USI2, the touchscreen's SPI. */
+/* CMU_HSI0: USI2, the touchscreen's SPI, and USI3, the GNSS receiver's SPI. */
 #define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_ALT		1
 #define CLK_MOUT_HSI0_NOC_USER		2
 #define CLK_MOUT_HSI0_ALT_USER		3
@@ -44,6 +44,11 @@
 #define CLK_DOUT_HSI0_USI2		8
 #define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI2_IP		9
 #define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI2_PCLK		10
+#define CLK_MOUT_HSI0_USI3		11
+#define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI3_SOURCE	12
+#define CLK_DOUT_HSI0_USI3		13
+#define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI3_IP		14
+#define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI3_PCLK		15
 
 /*
  * CMU_PERIC1: USI11, the I2C bus of the battery, charger and USB-C chips, and
